===Western side===
The western side of the dungeon, which is the [[Myths' Guild]] basement, is only accessible to members who have completed [[Dragon Slayer II]]. This can be accessed either through the [[Mythic Statue]] in the centre of the [[Myths' Guild]], or by passing the [[Magical Barrier|barriers]] being guarded by [[Ponts the Bridgemaster]] west of the ogresses.

Here players will find the [[Fountain of Uhld]], which can be used to recharge [[skills necklace]]s, [[combat bracelet]]s, and [[amulets of glory]], and a [[Myths' Guild mine|small mine]] containing 4 [[adamantite rocks]] and 2 [[runite rocks]].

The southern exit leads to a small island south of the Guild, and contains the [[Wrath Altar]], where players can craft [[wrath runes]].

